# PRD #1287 C1 — runtime artifacts of the M4 conformance subsystem; none are committed.
#   *.log / gate-log.*  : local gate/self-validation logs.
#   .codex-cache/       : the gitignored rootless test-cache prefix the provisioner
#                         installs into on a Linux host WITHOUT the image-baked package
#                         (D7 point 2). On this worker the image-baked path is taken and
#                         nothing lands here.
#   .evidence/          : the per-run executed-test evidence JSONL the conformance tests
#                         append to and run-completeness.ts reads (wired via CODEX_M4_EVIDENCE).
#   receipt-manifest.json : the REAL maintainer-produced candidate manifest (the packaged-proof
#                         base/jvm digests bound to the merge candidate) the D8 receipts gate binds
#                         against — real evidence, never committed. receipt-manifest.example.json IS
#                         tracked as the schema template, so this rule names the real file, not *.json.
*.log
gate-log.*
.codex-cache/
.evidence/
receipt-manifest.json
